02-02 13:52:51',1,1,NULL,'{\r\n	\"key\": -1,\r\n	\"description\": \"根节点\",\r\n	\"name\": \"root\",\r\n	\"type\": \"object\",\r\n	\"require\": false,\r\n	\"value\": \"\",\r\n	\"children\": [\r\n		{\r\n			\"description\": \"Cookie 请求头\",\r\n			\"name\": \"Cookie\",\r\n			\"type\": \"string\",\r\n			\"require\": false,\r\n			\"value\": \"\",\r\n			\"key\": \"axef8ad2a-csa1-48a8-bss1-ba5155acg4da\",\r\n			\"parentKey\": -1\r\n		},\r\n		{\r\n			\"description\": \"API 密钥, 值为 \"Bearer 密钥\"\",\r\n			\"name\": \"Authorization\",\r\n			\"type\": \"string\",\r\n			\"require\": false,\r\n			\"value\": \"\",\r\n			\"key\": \"245e2b31-bff6-2c1a-ec7c-3cf340480a98\",\r\n			\"parentKey\": -1\r\n		}\r\n	]\r\n}','创建知识库文档服务\r\n\r\n## 接口鉴权\r\n两种方式:\r\n\r\n* 使用 session 鉴权: 传递 `Cookie` 请求头，里面要包含 session 的 cookie（一般名为 `BOTE_SESSION`）\r\n  * 适用于从业务系统前端触发的调用，此时业务系统后端可以从请求中获取到 cookie, 然后转发给博特平台后端\r\n  * 博特平台不同环境使用的 session cookie 名称不同，为方便兼容所有环境，建议直接透传所有 cookie\r\n  * 示例: `Cookie: BOTE_SESSION=xxx`\r\n* API 密钥: 传递 `Authorization` 请求头，值为 \"Bearer 密钥\"\r\n  * 密钥在平台的【设置 - API 开放 - 鉴权】中申请\r\n  * 不依赖业务系统前端的 cookie, 适用于业务系统后端异步或者在定时任务中调用\r\n  * 示例: `Authorization: Bearer xxx`\r\n  \r\n## 接口地址\r\n\r\n* 请求方法: POST\r\n* 请求地址: `/bote/dc/library/create`（前面加上环境地址，比如生产环境完整地址为 `http://10.10.176.135:9500/bote/dc/library/create`）\r\n\r\n## 接口入参\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"libraryName\": \"文档库名称\",\r\n  \"visibilityScope\": \"PUBLIC\",\r\n  \"libraryIcon\": \"IcoLogoAirplayLinear\",\r\n  \"color\": \"#00B1FF\",\r\n  \"tenantId\": \"租户ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n## 接口出参\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n    \"resultCode\": \"0\",\r\n    \"resultMsg\": \"success\",\r\n    \"resultObject\": {\r\n        \"statusCd\": \"00A\",\r\n        \"creatorId\": \"创建人ID\",\r\n        \"id\": \"文档库ID\",\r\n        \"libraryId\": \"文档库业务ID\",\r\n        \"libraryName\": \"文档库名称\",\r\n        \"libraryIcon\": \"文档库图标\",\r\n        \"visibilityScope\": \"可见范围\",\r\n        \"ownerId\": \"所有者ID\",\r\n        \"sortOrder\": 0,\r\n        \"accessCount\": 0,\r\n        \"lastAccessTime\": \"最后访问时间\",\r\n        \"tenantId\": \"租户ID\",\r\n        \"color\": \"#00B1FF\"\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```','F'),(20260220202,'文档库修改','修改文档库基础信息','/bote/dc/library/settings/{libraryId}','POST',NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"children\":[{\"description\":\"文档库id\",\"name\":\"libraryId\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"d0efb2bc-4663-4cff-9a67-e9454ce2c0ad\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]}]}','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"name\":\"root\",\"key\":-1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"tenantId\",\"description\":\"tenantId\",\"key\":\"0c676841-d05f-404c-9c62-4cb6608c201c\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"spaceId\",\"description\":\"spaceId\",\"key\":\"c50b4f32-6f94-48e1-80cb-ee24d6a57d89\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"action\",\"description\":\"action\",\"key\":\"6a2aab7b-2c13-45ad-b5fd-460f7f60f7e1\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"type\":\"object\",\"name\":\"data\",\"description\":\"data\",\"key\":\"2752f1c6-e6fa-4877-9d0d-ef165c88ab8f\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"libraryName\",\"description\":\"libraryName\",\"key\":\"8c420c28-9e3e-4d51-acff-fb017ba5dd29\",\"parentKey\":\"2752f1c6-e6fa-4877-9d0d-ef165c88ab8f\",\"parentKeyPath\":[-1,\"2752f1c6-e6fa-4877-9d0d-ef165c88ab8f\"]},{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"description\",\"description\":\"description\",\"key\":\"384d6223-faab-4045-9e2e-105d49642ed7\",\"parentKey\":\"2752f1c6-e6fa-4877-9d0d-ef165c88ab8f\",\"parentKeyPath\":[-1,\"2752f1c6-e6fa-4877-9d0d-ef165c88ab8f\"]},{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"libraryIcon\",\"description\":\"libraryIcon\",\"key\":\"161f0a4b-e23d-4e1f-93b7-5d8d8941fc6d\",\"parentKey\":\"2752f1c6-e6fa-4877-9d0d-ef165c88ab8f\",\"parentKeyPath\":[-1,\"2752f1c6-e6fa-487