识别结果\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"515f0c1c-0499-43a1-adfd-1fb0a7bdceb6\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"content\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041804,'2025-08-15 14:55:46','00A','2025-08-15 15:03:38',1,1,NULL,'T','[\"view\"]'),(1274652617254883328,-1,'weChatMpAddMaterial','---\r\n## 新增永久素材\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n用于向公众号添加永久素材，包括图片、语音、视频和缩略图等。上传视频素材时需额外提供描述信息。\r\n---\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n#### 请求参数\r\n| 参数名      | 类型   | 必填 | 说明                                  |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|---------------------------------------|\r\n| accessToken | string | 是   | 接口调用凭据                          |\r\n| fileId      | string | 是   | 素材对应的文件Id（需先通过文件上传获取）|\r\n| description | object | 否   | 素材描述信息，上传视频素材时必填        |\r\n##### description（仅上传视频素材时必填）\r\n| 参数名       | 类型   | 必填 | 说明         |\r\n|--------------|--------|------|--------------|\r\n| title        | string | 是   | 素材描述标题 |\r\n| introduction | string | 是   | 素材描述简介 |\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n**图片/语音/缩略图等非视频素材：**\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\",\r\n  \"fileId\": \"FILE_ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n**视频素材：**\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\",\r\n  \"fileId\": \"FILE_ID\",\r\n  \"description\": {\r\n    \"title\": \"视频标题\",\r\n    \"introduction\": \"视频简介\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 3. 响应参数\r\n| 参数名   | 类型   | 说明                 |\r\n|----------|--------|----------------------|\r\n| message  | string | 返回消息（操作信息） |\r\n| mediaId  | string | 永久素材Id           |\r\n| mediaUrl | string | 素材url（部分类型返回）|\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"素材上传成功\",\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\",\r\n  \"mediaUrl\": \"https://example.com/media/url\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- `fileId` 需通过文件上传接口获取。\r\n- 上传视频素材时，`description` 字段必填。\r\n- `mediaUrl` 字段仅部分素材类型返回（如图片、视频等）。\r\n- `mediaId` 可用于后续消息群发、图文等功能。\r\n---','1','上传永久素材','微信公众号上传永久素材','data:image/png;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"84f4d84b-9e0e-48c1-944c-e38bdc684a20\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"素材对应的文件Id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"4770d028-5178-4449-bee8-23e51765764a\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"fileId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"素材描述信息，上传视频素材时必填\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"aa36ee98-dfb4-4b6a-96ea-4716202cdd74\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"description\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"素材描述标题\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"0337f4a1-f5dd-4435-8b92-990ad7dadd47\",\"parentKey\":\"aa36ee98-dfb4-4b6a-96ea-4716202cdd74\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"b1eebc73-8acf-41a7-9ba6-7fd412ec92dc\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"title\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"素材描述简介\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"a1d1b87f-fc70-44bc-bf92-8d9df37cce24\",\"parentKey\":\"aa36ee98-dfb4-4b6a-96ea-4716202cdd74\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"b1eebc73-8acf-41a7-9ba6-7fd412ec92dc\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"introduction\",\"children\":null}]}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"返回消息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"6639bbd3-9373-4925-9ad8-ca7a35dc6711\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"永久素材Id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"94306f2d-acde-4fc9-b7d0-b6be1e26dabf\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"素材url\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"405aedcc-3e2d-4b5e-871f-60e6fd1c51b4\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaUrl\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:22','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1274978722709086208,-1,'weChatMpAddGraphicMsg','---\r\n## 新增公众号草稿（图文消息\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n用于新增一条或多条图文消息至公众号草稿箱。每条图文消息可包含标题、作者、摘要、正文内容、封面图、评论设置等信息。\r\n---\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n#### 请求参数\r\n| 参数名      | 类型    | 必填 | 说明                 |\r\n|-------------|---------|------|----------------------|\r\n| accessToken | string  | 是   | 接口调用凭据         |\r\n| articles    | array   | 是   | 图文消息对象数组     |\r\n##### articles（图文消息对象）字段说明\r\n| 参数名             | 类型    | 必填 | 说明                                                                 |\r\n|--------------------|---------|------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|\r\n| title              | string  | 是   | 标题                                                                |\r\n| author             | string  | 否   | 作者                                                                |\r\n| digest             | string  | 否   | 图文消息的摘要。若不填写，默认抓取正文前54个字                      |\r\n| content            | string  | 是   | 图文消息的具体内容，支持HTML标签，必须少于2万字符                    |\r\n| contentSourceUrl   | string  | 否   | 图文消息的原文地址，即“阅读原文”的跳转URL                           |\r\n| thumbMediaId       | string  | 是   | 封面图片素材id（需通过素材上传接口获取）                             |\r\n| needOpenComment    | integer | 是   | 是否打开评论。0-关闭，1-打开                                         |\r\n| onlyFansCanComment | integer | 是   | 是否只有粉丝可评论。0-所有人，1-仅粉丝                               |\r\n##### needOpenComment 取值说明\r\n- 0：关闭\r\n- 1：打开\r\n##### onlyFansCanComment 取值说明\r\n- 0：所有人\r\n- 1：仅粉丝\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\",\r\n  \"articles\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"title\": \"示例标题\",\r\n      \"author\": \"作者名\",\r\n      \"digest\": \"摘要内容\",\r\n      \"content\": \"这里是正文内容\",\r\n      \"contentSourceUrl\": \"https://example.com/origin\",\r\n      \"thumbMediaId\": \"THUMB_MEDIA_ID\",\r\n      \"needOpenComment\": 1,\r\n      \"onlyFansCanComment\": 0\r\n    }\r\n    // 可添加多条图文\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 3. 响应参数\r\n| 参数名   | 类型   | 说明                   |\r\n|----------|--------|------------------------|\r\n| message  | string | 消息（接口操作信息）   |\r\n| mediaId  | string | 公众号草稿箱草稿Id     |\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"草稿创建成功\",\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- `thumbMediaId` 需通过微信素材上传接口获取。\r\n- `mediaId` 可用于后续草稿箱内容管理、发布等操作。\r\n- 支持批量添加多条图文消息（articles为数组）。\r\n---','1','新增草稿(图文消息)','微信公众号新增草稿(图文消息)','data:image/png;base64,','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":\"-1\",\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"1fa705d8-3524-4d5e-bf54-8fad9735c093\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"图文消息对象\",\"key\":\"103b09b8-2cb4-4d9a-92c8-54ece216328f\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"articles\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"listItem\",\"key\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKey\":\"103b09b8-2cb4-4d9a-92c8-54ece216328f\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\"],\"parentType\":\"array\",\"name\":\"listItem\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"标题\",\"key\":\"8ef55455-f942-49d8-bcd2-899b9b0ae5c3\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"title\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"作者\",\"key\":\"a8ad620a-3996-42cb-9fa6-03bed1d10482\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"author\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"图文消息的摘要，如果本字段为没有填写，则默认抓取正文前54个字\",\"key\":\"76f1cff2-2dfb-4360-a880-9acc9b63f779\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"digest\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\" 图文消息的具体内容，支持HTML标签，必须少于2万字符\",\"key\":\"90b9eb3b-36fb-42a5-ab5c-ca1042facb93\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"content\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"图文消息的原文地址，即点击“阅读原文”后的URL\",\"key\":\"006a405a-669d-4257-ac06-47d7ce3f38af\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"contentSourceUrl\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"封面图片素材id\",\"key\":\"44db2d6e-6382-4eea-81e2-dccd58253d89\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"thumbMediaId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"是否打开评论\",\"key\":\"813f0a4d-52d3-4b27-b17b-c7f30ffc7310\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"controlType\":\"select\",\"options\":[{\"value\":\"0\",\"label\":\"关闭\"},{\"value\":\"1\",\"label\":\"打开\"}],\"name\":\"needOpenComment\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"是否粉丝才可评论\",\"key\":\"62668845-c186-453e-b93c-b5b0b0ed2106\",\"parentKey\":\"ecfaea06-fa7b-4da2-a647-fa375986323d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"fee7b2b1-4863-4991-8dfb-04586deeda6f\",\"099d03b5-ffe4-4f45-90f3-4bba9dcea48e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"controlType\":\"select\",\"options\":[{\"value\":\"0\",\"label\":\"所有人\"},{\"value\":\"1\",\"label\":\"粉丝\"}],\"name\":\"onlyFansCanComment\",\"children\":null}]}]}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"消息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"77fc00b3-621a-48f2-b846-a5bc85a9819d\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"公众号草稿箱草稿Id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"eb57de85-4c11-4c47-90ee-887ed88d9f16\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275059881992286208,-1,'weChatMpAddPictureMsg','---\r\n## 新增公众号草稿（图片消息）\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n用于新增一条带图片的公众号草稿消息。调用本接口可向公众号草稿箱添加图文内容，支持图片信息和评论设置。\r\n---\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n#### 请求参数（Request Payload）\r\n| 参数名               | 类型    | 必填 | 说明                                                                                   |\r\n|----------------------|---------|------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\r\n| title                | string  | 是   | 标题                                                                                   |\r\n| content              | string  | 是   | 内容                                                                                   |\r\n| needOpenComment      | integer | 是   | 是否打开评论。0-不打开，1-打开                                                          |\r\n| onlyFansCanComment   | integer | 是   | 是否仅粉丝可评论。0-所有人，1-仅粉丝                                                    |\r\n| accessToken          | string  | 是   | 接口凭据                                                                               |\r\n| imageInfo            | object  | 否   | 图片信息，包含图片列表                                                                 |\r\n##### `imageInfo` 字段说明\r\n| 参数名    | 类型   | 必填 | 说明           |\r\n|-----------|--------|------|----------------|\r\n| imageList | array  | 否   | 图片列表       |\r\n- `imageList` 为图片对象数组，每个对象字段如下：\r\n| 参数名      | 类型   | 必填 | 说明           |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|----------------|\r\n| imageMediaId| string | 是   | 图片 media_id  |\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"title\": \"示例标题\",\r\n  \"content\": \"这里是正文内容\",\r\n  \"needOpenComment\": 1,\r\n  \"onlyFansCanComment\": 0,\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\",\r\n  \"imageInfo\": {\r\n    \"imageList\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"imageMediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID_1\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"imageMediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID_2\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n- `needOpenComment` 取值：0-不打开，1-打开  \r\n- `onlyFansCanComment` 取值：0-所有人，1-粉丝\r\n---\r\n### 3. 返回参数（Response Payload）\r\n| 参数名   | 类型   | 说明                   |\r\n|----------|--------|------------------------|\r\n| message  | string | 消息（接口操作信息）   |\r\n| mediaId  | string | 公众号草稿箱草稿Id     |\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"草稿创建成功\",\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n- `accessToken` 请通过相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- 图片`media_id`需通过素材上传接口获取。\r\n- 返回的`mediaId`可用于后续草稿箱内容管理。\r\n---','1','新增草稿(图片消息)','微信公众号新增草稿(图片消息)','data:image/png;base64,','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":\"-1\",\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"标题\",\"key\":\"0921cc3e-de5d-4219-939e-880c47f9e980\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"title\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"内容\",\"key\":\"d3bdd44d-80f0-4e93-a16b-9e7c08d99eb7\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"content\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"是否打开评论\",\"key\":\"78ad254e-de3e-4a14-9880-f82200a3f637\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"controlType\":\"select\",\"options\":[{\"value\":\"0\",\"label\":\"不打开\"},{\"value\":\"1\",\"label\":\"打开\"}],\"name\":\"needOpenComment\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"是否仅粉丝可评论\",\"key\":\"1b45a695-2148-487c-a090-cbc2c430c944\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"controlType\":\"select\",\"options\":[{\"value\":\"0\",\"label\":\"所有人\"},{\"value\":\"1\",\"label\":\"粉丝\"}],\"name\":\"onlyFansCanComment\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"d866bffc-9f94-4a3a-a77e-aef8db6c9f4b\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"图片信息\",\"key\":\"954529ea-46ac-48f7-b6e9-fa331ee20843\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"imageInfo\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"图片列表\",\"key\":\"56f91502-4a7f-45b5-a5bc-2d23d749ce17\",\"parentKey\":\"954529ea-46ac-48f7-b6e9-fa331ee20843\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"ce74713c-9437-45a6-a3cb-579c94afc3d8\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"imageList\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"listItem\",\"key\":\"8f5a1ef5-8b1e-404c-922e-ba157fa89887\",\"parentKey\":\"56f91502-4a7f-45b5-a5bc-2d23d749ce17\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"ce74713c-9437-45a6-a3cb-579c94afc3d8\",\"54e35a0d-ed56-48cb-8945-c7bf9dacef3d\"],\"parentType\":\"array\",\"name\":\"listItem\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"图片 media_id\",\"key\":\"98054066-da55-46c2-9361-c02125ce1def\",\"parentKey\":\"8f5a1ef5-8b1e-404c-922e-ba157fa89887\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"ce74713c-9437-45a6-a3cb-579c94afc3d8\",\"54e35a0d-ed56-48cb-8945-c7bf9dacef3d\",\"e573bfea-15ee-47e3-95eb-8ccbb4f49e28\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"imageMediaId\",\"children\":null}]}]}]}]}','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":-1,\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"消息\",\"key\":\"8b726cbf-93ca-4b85-ac17-11c00d91d03c\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"公众号草稿箱草稿Id\",\"key\":\"dd00142b-615c-4d6c-b033-7de8e3587238\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275361993708003328,-1,'larkCreateBitable','## 插件描述\r\n  飞书创建多维表格。\r\n  ## 操作说明\r\n   * 需要在飞书开放平台，创建一个应用。\r\n   * 在应用内的凭证与基础信息中，获取APP ID和  App Secret。\r\n   * 在应用内的开发配置的权限管理，请确保开通用户身份权限的以下权限：查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格（bitable:app）、离线访问已授权数据（offline_access）、查看知识库（wiki:wiki:readonly）、搜索云文档（search:docs:read）、查看云空间中文件元数据（drive:drive.metadata:readonly）的权限。\r\n   * 在应用内的安全设置中，配置重定向URL。\r\n      * url部分：/bote/lark/callback，网关请根据环境进行拼接，如当前环境接口为`http://127.0.0.1/api/xxxx`，则重定向URL为 `http://127.0.0.1/api/bote/lark/callback`\r\n   * 对此应用进行发布。\r\n  ## 插件出入参\r\n  * 入参\r\n      *  详情请参考[飞书开发者文档](https://open.feishu.cn/document/server-docs/docs/bitable-v1/app/create)。\r\n  * 出参\r\n     *  当 code 的值固定返回401时，此时需要用户打开飞书授权链接，进行授权，授权链接会返回在authUrl字段中。\r\n  ## 插件出参示例\r\n  ```json\r\n  {\r\n    \"code\": \"0\",\r\n    \"msg\": \"success\",\r\n    \"data\": {\r\n      \"authUrl\": null,\r\n      \"app\": {\r\n        \"authUrl\": null,\r\n        \"appToken\": \"DGiTbR6S8a8oNnsAWJVcIMMknec\",\r\n        \"name\": \"测试082903\",\r\n        \"folderToken\": \"\",\r\n        \"url\": \"https://bcn659k3jot5.feishu.cn/base/DGiTbR6S8a8oNnsAWJVcIMMknec\",\r\n        \"defaultTableId\": \"tblNQVFtpRpV1lqk\",\r\n        \"timeZone\": null\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  ```','1','飞书创建多维表格','飞书创建多维表格','data:image/svg+xml;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"应用ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"842082f2-a124-4c4a-a0b8-c9b5550007c6\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"应用密钥\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"43e4b27c-9f30-4518-9158-e2c600bb8039\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appSecret\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格名称\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"903992b2-69db-4003-940f-3b917dc21a93\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"name\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格App归属文件夹。默认为空，表示多维表格将被创建在云空间根目录(可选)\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"16612302-3a8f-4b7d-95cf-503f01f34eb4\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"folderToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"响应编码，成功返回0\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"ba5d3169-91b6-4f19-b214-736a496d22b8\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"code\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"错误信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"0a883121-1dca-48cf-b8db-ef5c86bdc5eb\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"msg\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"返回对象\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"c5793888-77bb-4700-9aa4-6d7d9b6590fe\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"data\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"用户授权链接\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"ed25ed61-bf8d-49ca-8331-c559df39ad3e\",\"parentKey\":\"c5793888-77bb-4700-9aa4-6d7d9b6590fe\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"authUrl\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"ad21bb14-00d2-4e5b-9b0c-335fbacc8f5a\",\"parentKey\":\"c5793888-77bb-4700-9aa4-6d7d9b6590fe\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"app\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"文档时区\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"808445c4-4d8c-4595-9208-5586cc5346dc\",\"parentKey\":\"ad21bb14-00d2-4e5b-9b0c-335fbacc8f5a\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"timeZone\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"默认创建的数据表ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"dd014d23-93a9-4810-a06c-dd30657d08c5\",\"parentKey\":\"ad21bb14-00d2-4e5b-9b0c-335fbacc8f5a\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\",\"f3651dd1-7db7-47e6-beba-0a4f8c872e97\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"defaultTableId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格的URL链接\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"d86c1738-08d6-49c8-b871-922dd8af3f63\",\"parentKey\":\"ad21bb14-00d2-4e5b-9b0c-335fbacc8f5a\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\",\"f3651dd1-7db7-47e6-beba-0a4f8c872e97\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"url\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格归属文件夹\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"0761afb2-66ba-4c14-9ba8-5319d0ed42b3\",\"parentKey\":\"ad21bb14-00d2-4e5b-9b0c-335fbacc8f5a\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\",\"f3651dd1-7db7-47e6-beba-0a4f8c872e97\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"folderToken\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格的名称\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"b50f15a7-3a8d-4848-ac76-32640b34648b\",\"parentKey\":\"ad21bb14-00d2-4e5b-9b0c-335fbacc8f5a\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\",\"f3651dd1-7db7-47e6-beba-0a4f8c872e97\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"name\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格唯一标识\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"7568b6ac-584c-4a17-ae6c-6f2e91c96568\",\"parentKey\":\"ad21bb14-00d2-4e5b-9b0c-335fbacc8f5a\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"d33bc00b-f51d-4008-a15f-28f8b73e54b1\",\"f3651dd1-7db7-47e6-beba-0a4f8c872e97\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appToken\",\"children\":null}]}]}]}',2025082201,'2025-08-20 15:53:14','00X','2025-09-01 11:18:36',1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275785421388898304,-1,'weChatMpGetStableToken','---\r\n## 获取 Access Token 接口说明\r\n### 1. 接口描述\r\n用于获取接口调用凭证（`access_token`）。调用本接口可获得授权后调用其他 API 所需的 access_token。\r\n---\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n#### 请求参数（Request Payload）\r\n| 参数名        | 类型    | 必填 | 说明                                                                       \r\n|---------------|---------|------|--------------------------------------------                                                 \r\n| appid         | string  | 是   | 账号的唯一凭证，即 AppID，点此查看如何获取 Appid                                                                                                |\r\n| secret        | string  | 是   | 唯一凭证密钥，即 AppSecret，点此查看如何获取 AppSecret                                                                                          |\r\n| force_refresh | boolean | 否   | 默认使用 false。<br>1. force_refresh = false 时为普通调用模式，access_token 有效期内重复调用该接口不会更新 access_token；<br>2. force_refresh = true 时为强制刷新模式，会导致上次获取的 access_token 失效，并返回新的 access_token |\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"appid\": \"your_appid_here\",\r\n  \"secret\": \"your_appsecret_here\",\r\n  \"force_refresh\": false\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 3. 返回参数（Response Payload）\r\n| 参数名        | 类型   | 说明                   |\r\n|---------------|--------|------------------------|\r\n| access_token  | string | 获取到的凭证           |\r\n| expires_in    | number | 凭证有效时间（秒），当前为7200秒之内的值 |\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"access_token\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\",\r\n  \"expires_in\": 7200\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n- `access_token` 是调用其他接口的必要参数，请妥善保存。\r\n- 当 `force_refresh` 为 true 时，会强制刷新并使之前的 `access_token` 失效，请谨慎使用。\r\n---','1','生成Token','生成微信公众号接口调用凭据','data:image/png;base64,','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":\"-1\",\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"微信公众号appid\",\"key\":\"58db17ef-0352-4ebe-a963-1c8610d8ea1a\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"appId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"微信公众号secret\",\"key\":\"c8179e4b-9f0c-42f7-8509-ef46774239fd\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"secret\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"description\":\"是否强制刷新\",\"key\":\"bbe2b5a5-4e6a-4d80-82d4-5e62b7e27e48\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"forceRefresh\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"执行信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"96264720-6d08-488e-ba69-4c5b576e438b\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"8d1e4824-dbff-4d5d-a111-77326609ecfa\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"剩余有效时间(秒)\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"a0a4fbe8-47ac-43fe-a4d9-07fed7c48c04\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"expiresIn\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275791866872324096,-1,'weChatMpPublishDraft','---\r\n\r\n## 发布公众号草稿\r\n\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n\r\n用于将指定草稿箱中的图文消息发布为正式的公众号文章。发布成功后，可获取发布任务ID用于后续查询发布状态。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n\r\n#### 请求参数\r\n\r\n| 参数名      | 类型   | 必填 | 说明           |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|----------------|\r\n| mediaId     | string | 是   | 草稿ID         |\r\n| accessToken | string | 是   | 接口调用凭据   |\r\n\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\",\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 3. 响应参数\r\n\r\n| 参数名    | 类型   | 说明                                 |\r\n|-----------|--------|--------------------------------------|\r\n| message   | string | 执行信息（接口操作结果说明）         |\r\n| publishId | string | 发布任务的id（用于查询发布状态）     |\r\n| msgDataId | string | 消息的数据id（用于群发、分析等场景） |\r\n| mediaId   | string | 发布的草稿id                        |\r\n\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"发布任务创建成功\",\r\n  \"publishId\": \"PUBLISH_ID\",\r\n  \"msgDataId\": \"MSG_DATA_ID\",\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- `mediaId` 为待发布的草稿ID，可通过草稿箱相关接口获取。\r\n- `publishId` 可用于后续查询发布任务状态。\r\n- `msgDataId` 可用于消息发送与数据分析场景。\r\n- 发布任务为异步处理，需通过任务ID轮询查询最终发布状态。\r\n\r\n---','1','发布草稿','微信公众号发布草稿','data:image/png;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"草稿ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"5fb71501-34cb-4091-986a-4851968f173d\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"a085105e-3579-4fd3-ad66-078aa25122f6\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"执行信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"a48df1da-7cf9-43f1-8de7-750cb6f5ca9c\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"发布任务的id(查询发布状态使用)\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"b08dbc2a-21e8-4b67-998c-ce192fcc5033\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"publishId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"消息的数据id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"40d044bf-a4f2-441d-b53a-b14b7410f61f\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"msgDataId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"发布的草稿id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"4f4fbbb6-2f9b-4edd-bda0-bfcecb7714c5\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275793866309623808,-1,'weChatMpQryPublishState','---\r\n\r\n## 查询公众号文章发布状态\r\n\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n\r\n用于查询指定发布任务的图文消息发布状态及详情。可用于轮询发布结果，获取文章永久链接等信息。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n\r\n#### 请求参数\r\n\r\n| 参数名      | 类型   | 必填 | 说明           |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|----------------|\r\n| publishId   | string | 是   | 发布任务的id   |\r\n| accessToken | string | 是   | 接口调用凭据   |\r\n\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"publishId\": \"PUBLISH_ID\",\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 3. 响应参数\r\n\r\n| 参数名         | 类型    | 说明                                 |\r\n|----------------|---------|--------------------------------------|\r\n| message        | string  | 执行信息（接口操作结果说明）         |\r\n| publishId      | string  | 发布ID                               |\r\n| publishStatus  | integer | 发布状态（见下方状态码说明）         |\r\n| articleId      | string  | 文章ID（发布成功时返回）             |\r\n| articleDetail  | object  | 文章详情（发布成功时返回，见下表）   |\r\n\r\n#### articleDetail 字段说明（仅发布成功时有值）\r\n\r\n| 参数名 | 类型   | 说明             |\r\n|--------|--------|------------------|\r\n| count  | int    | 文章数量         |\r\n| item   | array  | 文章详情列表     |\r\n\r\n**item 数组说明：**\r\n\r\n| 参数名       | 类型   | 说明               |\r\n|--------------|--------|--------------------|\r\n| idx          | int    | 文章对应的编号     |\r\n| article_url  | string | 图文的永久链接     |\r\n\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"发布成功\",\r\n  \"publishId\": \"PUBLISH_ID\",\r\n  \"publishStatus\": 0,\r\n  \"articleId\": \"ARTICLE_ID\",\r\n  \"articleDetail\": {\r\n    \"count\": 2,\r\n    \"item\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"idx\": 1,\r\n        \"article_url\": \"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xxxx\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"idx\": 2,\r\n        \"article_url\": \"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yyyy\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 4. 发布状态码说明\r\n\r\n| 状态码 | 说明                               |\r\n|--------|------------------------------------|\r\n| 0      | 发布成功                           |\r\n| 1      | 发布中                             |\r\n| 2      | 原创失败                           |\r\n| 3      | 常规失败                           |\r\n| 4      | 平台审核不通过                     |\r\n| 5      | 发布成功后，用户删除了所有文章     |\r\n| 6      | 发布成功后，系统封禁了所有文章     |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 5. 备注\r\n\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- 建议在发布后定时轮询查询发布状态，直至为“发布成功”或终态。\r\n- `articleDetail` 仅在发布成功（publishStatus=0）时返回，包含所有文章的永久链接等信息。\r\n\r\n---','1','查询已发布文章状态','微信公众号查询已发布文章状态','data:image/png;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"发布任务的id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"34eb5101-b602-4a71-a320-c775d764f7b0\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"publishId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"a9c1b61d-7e1d-4b3d-9be1-7c6fad66535b\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":-1,\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"执行信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"6af52f54-ab83-41e2-b449-f33c02356bd9\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"发布ID\",\"key\":\"43c34df5-32d7-4a8a-acbb-1d90843d6857\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"publishId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"发布状态\",\"key\":\"9357e6cb-799c-44c0-812f-12b45a5807ad\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"publishStatus\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"文章ID\",\"key\":\"f0787859-8543-4113-9758-9fcaca99d27e\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"articleId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"文章详情(成功时才有值)\",\"key\":\"aeb8a535-285f-4050-aa98-81cb1766ef06\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"articleDetail\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"文章数量\",\"key\":\"4ae8e1cb-4d85-4e51-9ded-e7e7fe6860e7\",\"parentKey\":\"aeb8a535-285f-4050-aa98-81cb1766ef06\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"453559f7-f5d5-4a33-a494-3185e442d176\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"count\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"文章详情\",\"key\":\"ca77d10a-47f3-4ad6-8d68-0f14812f6926\",\"parentKey\":\"aeb8a535-285f-4050-aa98-81cb1766ef06\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"453559f7-f5d5-4a33-a494-3185e442d176\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"listItem\",\"key\":\"720f1823-629d-4f9a-b35a-1440b647463d\",\"parentKey\":\"ca77d10a-47f3-4ad6-8d68-0f14812f6926\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"453559f7-f5d5-4a33-a494-3185e442d176\",\"dd0d3e4f-cf4a-489a-87dd-086f9db13ac0\"],\"parentType\":\"array\",\"name\":\"listItem\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"文章对应的编号\",\"key\":\"98acabf9-d30b-4f08-b0d6-59a231ed1930\",\"parentKey\":\"720f1823-629d-4f9a-b35a-1440b647463d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"453559f7-f5d5-4a33-a494-3185e442d176\",\"dd0d3e4f-cf4a-489a-87dd-086f9db13ac0\",\"f5b83bbb-030a-451c-837e-fe1746842304\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"idx\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"图文的永久链接\",\"key\":\"139bb6a7-6e93-470e-8b11-41a57282e429\",\"parentKey\":\"720f1823-629d-4f9a-b35a-1440b647463d\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"453559f7-f5d5-4a33-a494-3185e442d176\",\"dd0d3e4f-cf4a-489a-87dd-086f9db13ac0\",\"f5b83bbb-030a-451c-837e-fe1746842304\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"article_url\",\"children\":null}]}]}]}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275794628641153024,-1,'weChatMpDelDraft','---\r\n\r\n## 删除公众号草稿\r\n\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n\r\n用于根据草稿ID删除指定的公众号图文草稿。\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n#### 请求参数\r\n\r\n| 参数名      | 类型   | 必填 | 说明         |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|--------------|\r\n| mediaId     | string | 是   | 草稿ID       |\r\n| accessToken | string | 是   | 接口凭据     |\r\n\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\",\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 3. 响应参数\r\n\r\n| 参数名   | 类型   | 说明           |\r\n|----------|--------|----------------|\r\n| message  | string | 执行信息       |\r\n| mediaId  | string | 草稿ID         |\r\n\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"删除成功\",\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- 删除操作不可恢复，请谨慎操作。\r\n- 若删除失败，`message` 字段会返回失败原因。\r\n\r\n---','1','删除草稿','微信公众号删除草稿','data:image/png;base64,','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":\"-1\",\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"草稿ID\",\"key\":\"92e53528-158e-4a36-8edc-04a6c7af60db\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"key\":\"27ff0af0-6454-464c-bc9d-ea65c567ebea\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"执行信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"babfaa76-689e-4479-933b-895849c1537f\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"草稿Id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"95a1cf81-864a-4085-a024-dc5cb060c14c\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275796178130296832,-1,'weChatMpDelMaterial','---\r\n## 删除公众号素材\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n用于根据素材ID删除指定的公众号图文草稿。\r\n---\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n#### 请求参数\r\n| 参数名      | 类型   | 必填 | 说明         |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|--------------|\r\n| mediaId     | string | 是   | 素材ID       |\r\n| accessToken | string | 是   | 接口凭据     |\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\",\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 3. 响应参数\r\n| 参数名   | 类型   | 说明           |\r\n|----------|--------|----------------|\r\n| message  | string | 执行信息       |\r\n| mediaId  | string | 素材ID         |\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"删除成功\",\r\n  \"mediaId\": \"MEDIA_ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- 删除操作不可恢复，请谨慎操作。\r\n- 若删除失败，`message` 字段会返回失败原因。\r\n---','1','删除素材','微信公众号删除草稿','data:image/png;base64,','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":\"-1\",\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"素材ID\",\"key\":\"7f815b18-3ea3-4f97-b384-ac4867d8095f\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"key\":\"9eeb8412-9274-47b5-b7c5-4afdcec51d84\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"执行信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"eae78d9c-29a0-4480-9263-bc513ceeabef\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"素材Id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"27c323a0-def9-46e7-a400-6cd50a31f713\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"mediaId\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1275796573778993152,-1,'weChatMpDelPublish','---\r\n## 删除公众号文章\r\n### 1. 描述\r\n用于根据文章ID删除指定的公众号图文草稿。\r\n---\r\n### 2. 请求说明\r\n#### 请求参数\r\n| 参数名      | 类型   | 必填 | 说明         |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|--------------|\r\n| articleId     | string | 是   | 文章ID       |\r\n| accessToken | string | 是   | 接口凭据     |\r\n##### 示例请求体\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"articleId\": \"MEDIA_ID\",\r\n  \"accessToken\": \"ACCESS_TOKEN\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 3. 响应参数\r\n| 参数名   | 类型   | 说明           |\r\n|----------|--------|----------------|\r\n| message  | string | 执行信息       |\r\n| articleId  | string | 文章ID         |\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"删除成功\",\r\n  \"articleId\": \"MEDIA_ID\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n---\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- 删除操作不可恢复，请谨慎操作。\r\n- 若删除失败，`message` 字段会返回失败原因。\r\n---','1','删除发布的文章','微信公众号删除发布的文章','data:image/png;base64,','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":\"-1\",\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"文章Id\",\"key\":\"41ca60f8-c947-4c94-8d9c-d4105ddbeb2b\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"articleId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"接口凭据\",\"key\":\"034eb207-3a5d-40ee-964c-88abc65d265f\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"执行信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"f4303306-b925-4c1f-86a5-74ce21db8c58\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"素材Id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"b869838e-d0d1-4ca9-9e44-ff2ffbd212cf\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"articleId\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041805,'2025-09-12 09:55:21','00X',NULL,1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1276013250355286016,-1,'larkListTables','## 插件描述\r\n  飞书多维表格获取数据表\r\n  ## 操作说明\r\n   * 需要在飞书开放平台，创建一个应用。\r\n   * 在应用内的凭证与基础信息中，获取APP ID和  App Secret。\r\n   * 在应用内的开发配置的权限管理，请确保开通用户身份权限的以下权限：查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格（bitable:app）、离线访问已授权数据（offline_access）、查看知识库（wiki:wiki:readonly）、搜索云文档（search:docs:read）、查看云空间中文件元数据（drive:drive.metadata:readonly）的权限。\r\n   * 在应用内的安全设置中，配置重定向URL。\r\n      * url部分：/bote/lark/callback，网关请根据环境进行拼接，如当前环境接口为`http://127.0.0.1/api/xxxx`，则重定向URL为 `http://127.0.0.1/api/bote/lark/callback`\r\n   * 对此应用进行发布。\r\n  ## 插件出入参\r\n  * 入参\r\n      * （appToken、tableId） 与 url 只要填其一。\r\n      *  详情请参考[飞书开发者文档](https://open.feishu.cn/document/server-docs/docs/bitable-v1/app-table/list)。\r\n  * 出参\r\n     *  当 code 的值固定返回401时，此时需要用户打开飞书授权链接，进行授权，授权链接会返回在authUrl字段中。\r\n  ## 插件出参示例\r\n  ```json\r\n  {\r\n    \"code\": \"0\",\r\n    \"msg\": \"success\",\r\n    \"data\": {\r\n      \"items\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"tableId\": \"tblNQVFtpRpV1lqk\",\r\n          \"name\": \"数据表\",\r\n          \"revision\": \"0\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"pageToken\": \"tblNQVFtpRpV1lqk\",\r\n      \"total\": \"1\",\r\n      \"hasMore\": false,\r\n      \"authUrl\": null\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  ```','1','飞书多维表格获取数据表','飞书多维表格获取数据表','data:image/svg+xml;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"应用ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"cdd8b7a9-1671-4d89-894c-6270bbacfd10\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"应用密钥\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"e6d29d62-bb15-4eb8-88fc-d6c0c5de835e\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appSecret\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"应用Token\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"ca9d6b0d-a05f-4582-a2a0-5a91e36e263b\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appToken\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格url\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"d7f97bb3-274e-4207-b1c3-ddec21881ab2\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"url\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"分页大小，默认20\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"cafc2c5c-f4b4-4ac0-b954-53edd138b3b8\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"pageSize\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"分页标记\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"b1005f21-8bb0-4017-8264-0be867b80e69\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"pageToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"响应编码，成功返回0\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"9120da9b-ae08-40ed-9ee7-fd4ac8d3b964\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"code\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"错误信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"4bbbe613-ec24-46ff-a69a-2965cca58218\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"msg\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"返回对象\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"1697c9cf-9f5c-44fe-8b59-c88b6881d9b9\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"data\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"数据表列表\",\"type\":\"array\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"4cc0e50c-01f1-4b8d-a338-5f3c0be4197c\",\"parentKey\":\"1697c9cf-9f5c-44fe-8b59-c88b6881d9b9\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"5dacd7a1-3ca0-49c2-8d67-6a7dde877c32\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"items\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"数据表信息\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"15a7c456-bf5e-4878-8f76-908c0baf6ae9\",\"parentKey\":\"