| 说明           |\r\n|-----------|---------|----------------|\r\n| message   | string  | 执行信息       |\r\n| articleId | string  | 文章ID         |\r\n| newsItem  | array   | 图文详情列表   |\r\n\r\nnewsItem 数组结构如下：\r\n\r\n| 字段名                 | 类型   | 说明                |\r\n|------------------------|--------|---------------------|\r\n| title                  | string | 标题                |\r\n| author                 | string | 作者                |\r\n| digest                 | string | 摘要                |\r\n| content                | string | 文章内容            |\r\n| content_source_url     | string | 原文链接            |\r\n| thumb_media_id         | string | 封面图片媒体ID      |\r\n| thumb_url              | string | 封面图片URL         |\r\n| show_cover_pic         | int    | 是否显示封面        |\r\n| need_open_comment      | int    | 是否打开评论0不打开(默认)，1打开        |\r\n| only_fans_can_comment  | int    | 仅粉丝可评论 0所有人可评论(默认)，1粉丝才可评论       |\r\n| url                    | string | 图文详情URL         |\r\n| is_deleted             | boolean    | 是否已删除   |\r\n\r\n##### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"message\": \"获取成功\",\r\n  \"articleId\": \"MEDIA_ID\",\r\n  \"newsItem\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"title\": \"文章标题\",\r\n      \"author\": \"作者名\",\r\n      \"digest\": \"文章摘要\",\r\n      \"content\": \"<p>文章内容</p>\",\r\n      \"content_source_url\": \"https://original.com/article\",\r\n      \"thumb_media_id\": \"THUMB_MEDIA_ID\",\r\n      \"thumb_url\": \"https://image.url/cover.jpg\",\r\n      \"show_cover_pic\": 1,\r\n      \"need_open_comment\": 1,\r\n      \"only_fans_can_comment\": 0,\r\n      \"url\": \"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/xxxx\",\r\n      \"is_deleted\": false\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 4. 备注\r\n\r\n- `accessToken` 需通过公众号相关接口获取并保证有效。\r\n- 若文章已被删除，`is_deleted` 字段返回 true，且其他字段可能为空。\r\n- 若获取失败，`message` 字段会返回失败原因。\r\n\r\n---','1','查询已发布的文章信息','微信公众号查询发布的文章信息','data:image/png;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"发布任务articleId\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"7c33e096-3119-48f5-a864-ddc08203ff31\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"articleId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"公众号access_token\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"d765aef2-8e0b-4c26-bb18-3c884136f302\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"accessToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":-1,\"parentKey\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"执行信息\",\"key\":\"b2db1584-0045-41ea-99ee-32ff50d1f295\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"message\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"发布任务articleId\",\"key\":\"b4deea1b-eb04-4abb-b528-7d7eb6679824\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"articleId\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"图文信息集合\",\"key\":\"a5f42374-31f8-4674-9810-9a7fd47efe10\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"newsItem\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"listItem\",\"key\":\"5ace23af-6079-4d03-91ce-731b54049ebd\",\"parentKey\":\"a5f42374-31f8-4674-9810-9a7fd47efe10\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"363e6803-fc3d-45df-9898-18b198f5adcd\"],\"parentType\":\"array\",\"name\":\"listItem\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"标题\",\"key\":\"44534b57-9247-4648-a966-a37d6d15bed9\",\"parentKey\":\"5ace23af-6079-4d03-91ce-731b54049ebd\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"363e6803-fc3d-45df-9898-18b198f5adcd\",\"2677c519-b19c-45c8-984f-d77651812627\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"title\",\"children\":null},{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"作者\",\"key\