"description\":\"授权链接\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"d95d0cc4-3099-484f-a44b-693f351b1c11\",\"parentKey\":\"ebe6a163-238f-4a43-8840-62e0d18d7939\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"172f1095-76bf-4315-9856-256c1c3935c2\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"authUrl\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"记录列表\",\"type\":\"array\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"3948114c-4058-42a4-98c9-9591a4d75a05\",\"parentKey\":\"ebe6a163-238f-4a43-8840-62e0d18d7939\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"172f1095-76bf-4315-9856-256c1c3935c2\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"records\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"记录\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"8ad0dfd2-74b5-4123-a4fb-30595b9fd25b\",\"parentKey\":\"3948114c-4058-42a4-98c9-9591a4d75a05\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"172f1095-76bf-4315-9856-256c1c3935c2\",\"d3adaa43-4a1e-42e8-a627-b3ec5a921bee\"],\"parentType\":\"array\",\"name\":\"record\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"字段\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"50825516-46ee-4e91-a9b8-67cc06b9af3f\",\"parentKey\":\"8ad0dfd2-74b5-4123-a4fb-30595b9fd25b\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"172f1095-76bf-4315-9856-256c1c3935c2\",\"d3adaa43-4a1e-42e8-a627-b3ec5a921bee\",\"e32d47ad-0f3d-419a-93f3-b6a110ae988b\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"fields\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"记录ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"fdcfd13a-91f0-438c-b3e9-b917618c7fc0\",\"parentKey\":\"8ad0dfd2-74b5-4123-a4fb-30595b9fd25b\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"172f1095-76bf-4315-9856-256c1c3935c2\",\"d3adaa43-4a1e-42e8-a627-b3ec5a921bee\",\"e32d47ad-0f3d-419a-93f3-b6a110ae988b\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"recordId\",\"children\":null}]}]}]},{\"description\":\"错误信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"e7a803fb-8f57-49d3-b005-509b18303359\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"msg\",\"children\":null}]}',2025082201,'2025-08-26 13:57:39','00X','2025-09-01 15:08:06',1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1277526119055327232,-1,'linkExtractor','## 1. 描述\r\n用于从文本内容中提取HTTP/HTTPS链接。支持从复杂的文本中识别和提取各种格式的URL链接，包括带端口号、路径、参数和锚点的完整链接。\r\n## 2. 请求说明\r\n### 请求参数\r\n| 参数名 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |\r\n|-------------|--------|------|----------------|\r\n| text | string | 是 | 待处理的文本内容 |\r\n#### 示例请求体\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"text\": \"这是一个包含链接的文本，访问 https://www.example.com:8080/path?param=value#anchor 获取更多信息，还有 http://test.com\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n## 3. 响应参数\r\n| 参数名 | 类型 | 说明 |\r\n|-----------|--------|--------------------------------------|\r\n| urls | array | 提取到的链接列表 |\r\n#### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"urls\": [\r\n    \"https://www.example.com:8080/path?param=value#anchor\"\r\n  ,\"http://test.com\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n## 4. 备注\r\n- `text` 参数不能为空，否则会抛出异常。\r\n- 插件使用正则表达式匹配HTTP/HTTPS链接，支持各种复杂的URL格式。\r\n- 支持包含端口号、路径、查询参数和锚点的完整URL提取。\r\n- 如果输入文本中没有找到有效的链接，返回空的urls数组。\r\n- 插件会自动过滤不符合URL格式的匹配结果。\r\n- 不支持匹配带中文的URL\r\n### 支持的链接格式示例：\r\n- **基础域名**：\r\n  - `http://example.com`\r\n  - `https://www.example.com`\r\n  - `https://subdomain.example.com`\r\n- **带端口号**：\r\n  - `http://localhost:8080`\r\n  - `https://api.example.com:443`\r\n  - `http://127.0.0.1:3000`\r\n- **带路径**：\r\n  - `https://example.com/path`\r\n  - `http://example.com/path/to/resource`\r\n  - `https://example.com/path/with/slashes/`\r\n- **带查询参数**：\r\n  - `https://example.com/search?q=keyword`\r\n  - `http://example.com/api?param1=value1&param2=value2`\r\n  - `https://example.com/page?id=123&category=tech`\r\n- **带锚点**：\r\n  - `https://example.com/page#section1`\r\n  - `http://example.com/doc#chapter2`\r\n  - `https://example.com/blog#comments`\r\n- **复杂组合**：\r\n  - `https://api.example.com:8080/v1/users?filter=active&limit=10#results`\r\n  - `http://localhost:3000/search?q=java%20tutorial&page=2#top`\r\n  - `https://sub.domain.example.com:443/path/to/api?token=abc123&format=json#response`\r\n- **特殊字符处理**：\r\n  - `https://example.com/path%20with%20spaces`\r\n  - `http://example.com/search?q=hello%20world`\r\n### 不支持的格式：\r\n- 无协议的域名（如 `www.example.com`）\r\n- FTP等其他协议（如 `ftp://example.com`）\r\n- 相对路径（如 `/path/to/resource`）\r\n- 邮箱地址（如 `user@example.com`）','1','提取链接','用于从包含文字和链接的混合内容中精准提取出链接。','./images/plugin/ico-plugin-2.png','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"86a628bf-3cd6-483d-82e2-4442ed92da29\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"text\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"key\":-1,\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"urls\",\"key\":\"2253808c-8d2b-41c6-9cf5-d7df580b2912\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"name\":\"urls\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"listItem\",\"key\":\"9f42c28a-a05e-48f6-a54b-ee7e314d9bd4\",\"parentKey\":\"2253808c-8d2b-41c6-9cf5-d7df580b2912\",\"name\":\"listItem\",\"children\":[]}]}]}',2025041802,'2025-08-26 15:12:42','00A','2025-08-26 16:56:27',1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1277567890065948672,-1,'larkSearchDoc','## 插件描述\r\n  飞书搜索多维表格类型的文档\r\n  ## 操作说明\r\n   * 需要在飞书开放平台，创建一个应用。\r\n   * 在应用内的凭证与基础信息中，获取APP ID和  App Secret。\r\n   * 在应用内的开发配置的权限管理，请确保开通用户身份权限的以下权限：查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格（bitable:app）、离线访问已授权数据（offline_access）、查看知识库（wiki:wiki:readonly）、搜索云文档（search:docs:read）、查看云空间中文件元数据（drive:drive.metadata:readonly）的权限。\r\n   * 在应用内的安全设置中，配置重定向URL。\r\n      * url部分：/bote/lark/callback，网关请根据环境进行拼接，如当前环境接口为`http://127.0.0.1/api/xxxx`，则重定向URL为 `http://127.0.0.1/api/bote/lark/callback`\r\n  ## 插件参数说明\r\n  * 入参\r\n    *  (appToken、tableId) 与 url 只要填其一\r\n    *  详情请参考[飞书开发者文档](https://open.feishu.cn/document/server-docs/docs/drive-v1/search/document-search)\r\n  * 出参\r\n     *  当 code 的值固定返回401时，此时需要用户打开飞书授权链接，进行授权，授权链接会返回在authUrl字段中。\r\n  ## 插件出参示例\r\n  ```json\r\n  {\r\n    \"code\": \"0\",\r\n    \"msg\": \"success\",\r\n    \"data\": {\r\n      \"docsEntities\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"docsToken\": \"DGiTbR6S8a8oNnsAWJVcIMMknec\",\r\n          \"docsType\": \"bitable\",\r\n          \"ownerId\": \"ou_0d560b536e25c5188f29cb45090d31b1\",\r\n          \"title\": \"测试082903\",\r\n          \"url\": \"https://bcn659k3jot5.feishu.cn/base/DGiTbR6S8a8oNnsAWJVcIMMknec\"\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"docsToken\": \"SlhTbHGXGaSOd1sV3NXcLKdnnNh\",\r\n          \"docsType\": \"bitable\",\r\n          \"ownerId\": \"ou_0d560b536e25c5188f29cb45090d31b1\",\r\n          \"title\": \"测试082902\",\r\n          \"url\": \"https://bcn659k3jot5.feishu.cn/base/SlhTbHGXGaSOd1sV3NXcLKdnnNh\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"authUrl\": null\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  ```','1','飞书搜索多维表格类型的文档','飞书搜索多维表格类型的文档','data:image/svg+xml;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"应用ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"f947dd2d-eb54-46a1-9f1c-2b051d136724\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"应用密钥\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"bbe5f686-ea79-4273-837f-67cf1fa66ec3\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appSecret\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"指定搜索的关键字\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"46329ef3-a802-4cc2-92b8-88b2ec904c6e\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"searchKey\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"指定搜索返回的文件数量。取值范围为[0,50]。\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"value\":\"\",\