*  当 code 的值固定返回401时，此时需要用户打开飞书授权链接，进行授权，授权链接会返回在authUrl字段中。\r\n  ## 插件出参示例\r\n  ```json\r\n  {\r\n    \"code\": \"0\",\r\n    \"msg\": \"success\",\r\n    \"data\": {\r\n      \"records\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"recordId\": \"reccRxgtky\",\r\n          \"deleted\": true\r\n        },\r\n        {\r\n          \"recordId\": \"rslifjwjcmld\",\r\n          \"deleted\": true\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"authUrl\": null\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  ```','1','飞书多维表格批量删除数据表记录','飞书多维表格批量删除数据表记录','data:image/svg+xml;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"应用ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"0fd1d5a7-2e60-4152-b057-46405beba1d6\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"应用密钥\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"25547a78-c22b-40a2-800b-96c76436f616\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appSecret\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格链接地址\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"de5ffb73-f7bb-4fee-9e60-2c27a4ba33a7\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"url\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"表格ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"e8806c89-c007-4ed6-8267-9b1f61d9fddd\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"tableId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格唯一标识\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"5e8d998d-6220-43bd-9670-797498d7a58a\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appToken\",\"children\":null},{\"descr