n\r\n{ \"file\": \"123456\", \"type\": \"bote\" }\r\n```\r\n#### 示例2：使用Base64编码文件\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n	\"file\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAUA\",\r\n	\"type\": \"base64\",\r\n	\"fileName\": \"example.png\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n#### 响应示例\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n	\"tables\": [\r\n		\"<table><thead><tr><th>姓名</th><th>年龄</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>张三</td><td>25</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\r\n		\"<table><thead><tr><th>产品</th><th>价格</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>苹果</td><td>5.00</td></tr></tbody></table>\"\r\n	]\r\n}\r\n```','1','表格提取','用于从文档中提取表格数据，支持Word、PDF和图片格式的文件','./images/plugin/ico-plugin-2.png','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"文件内容（文件ID或Base64编码）\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"3b486c41-1705-4929-b3a8-fb59399a0cbb\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"file\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"文件类型（bote或base64）\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"46c66ea5-18d4-4755-bdaf-2bd42110bc64\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"type\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"文件名（当type为base64时必需）\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"38e25cbc-9f6a-433f-b2f1-02a48c7e2db1\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"fileName\",\"children\":null,\"controlType\":\"select\",\"options\":[{\"value\":\"base64\",\"label\":\"Base64\"},{\"value\":\"bote\",\"label\":\"平台\"}]}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"提取出的表格HTML内容列表\",\"type\":\"array\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"f625072b-2d68-4442-b2e7-121352f54046\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"ta