 \"input\": \"curl --location --request POST \'http://10.10.176.135:9500/bote/manager/knowledge/saveKnowledgeBase\' --header \'Authorization: Bearer abcd***1234\' --header \'Content-Type: application/json\' --header \'Accept: */*\' --data-raw \'{\"knowledgeName\":\"修改后的知识库名称\",\"catalogItemId\":1333312948591554560,\"knowledgeDesc\":\"知识库描述\",\"knowledgeType\":\"docChain\",\"knowledgeIcon\":\"IcoLogoAirplayLinear\",\"isExist\":\"F\",\"topicId\":4648,\"knowledgeId\":1334792822373715968,\"tenantId\":1333274173882658816,\"spaceId\":1333274086678884352}\'\",\r\n  \"output\": \"{\n  \"resultCode\": \"0\",\n  \"resultMsg\": \"success\",\n  \"resultObject\": {\n    \"statusCd\": \"00A\",\n    \"updatorId\": \"1\",\n    \"updatedTime\": \"2026-01-31 15:50:23\",\n    \"knowledgeId\": \"1334792822373715968\",\n    \"catalogItemId\": \"1333312948591554560\",\n    \"tenantId\": \"1333274173882658816\",\n    \"spaceId\": \"1333274086678884352\",\n    \"knowledgeType\": \"docChain\",\n    \"knowledgeName\": \"等等的点点滴滴\",\n    \"knowledgeIcon\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\",\n    \"fileCounts\": \"0\",\n    \"knowledgeStatus\": \"10D\",\n    \"topicId\": \"7567\",\n    \"knowledgeStrategy\": \"{\\\"llm_model_name\\\":\\\"DeepSeek-V3(外部)\\\",...}\",\n    \"isExist\": \"F\",\n    \"strategy\": {\n      \"llm_model_name\": \"DeepSeek-V3(外部)\",\n      \"env_lang\": \"zh\",\n      \"chat_with_neo4j\": \"common\",\n      \"embedding_model_name\": \"auto\",\n      \"image_search\": \"cnclip\",\n      \"common_config\": { \"doc_parse_type\": \"common\", \"chunk_size\": 512 },\n      \"retrieve_config\": { \"recall_node_limit\": \"10\", \"recall_data_limit\": \"50\" }\n    }\n  }\n}\"\r\n}',202602202,'2026-02-02 18:03:12','00A','2026-02-02 18:03:12',1,1,NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"Cookie 请求头\",\"name\":\"Cookie\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"axef8ad2a-csa1-48a8-bss1-ba5155acg4da\",\"parentKey\":-1},{\"description\":\"API 密钥, 值为 Bearer 密钥\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"245e2b31-bff6-2c1a-ec7c-3cf340480a98\",\"parentKey\":-1}]}','修改知识库服务\r\n\r\n## 接口鉴权\r\n两种方式:\r\n\r\n* 使用 session 鉴权: 传递 `Cookie` 请求头，里面要包含 session 的 cookie（一般名为 `BOTE_SESSION`）\r\n  * 适用于从业务系统前端触发的调用，此时业务系统后端可以从请求中获取到 cookie, 然后转发给博特平台后端\r\n  * 博特平台不同环境使用的 session cookie 名称不同，为方便兼容所有环境，建议直接透传所有 cookie\r\n  * 示例: `Cookie: BOTE_SESSION=xxx`\r\n* API 密钥: 传递 `Authorization` 请求头，值为 \"Bearer 密钥\"\r\n  * 密钥在平台的【设置 - API 开放 - 鉴权】中申请\r\n  * 不依赖业务系统前端的 cookie, 适用于业务系统后端异步或者在定时任务中调用\r\n  * 示例: `Authorization: Bearer xxx`\r\n\r\n## 接口地址\r\n\r\n* 请求方法: POST\r\n* 请求地址: `/bote/manager/knowledge/saveKnowledgeBase`（前面加上环境地址，与新增知识库共用同一接口，通过传入 knowledgeId 区分新增/修改）\r\n\r\n## 接口入参（请求体）\r\n| 字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |\r\n|------|------|------|------|\r\n| knowledgeName | string | 是 | 知识库名称 |\r\n| catalogItemId | integer | 是 | 目录项ID |\r\n| knowledgeDesc | string | 否 | 知识库描述 |\r\n| knowledgeType | string | 是 | 知识库类型，默认传 \"docChain\" |\r\n| strategy | object | 否 | docchain的构建策略，复杂对象 |\r\n| knowledgeIcon | string | 否 | 知识库图标，默认传 \"IcoLogoAirplayLinear\" |\r\n| isExist | string | 是 | 是否存在，是否在docchain的维护文档，默认传 \"F\" |\r\n| topicId | integer | 是 | 主题ID |\r\n| knowledgeId | integer | 是 | 知识库ID（修改时必传） |\r\n| tenantId | integer | 是 | 租户ID |\r\n| spaceId | integer | 否 | 空间ID |\r\n\r\n## 接口出参\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"resultCode\": \"0\",\r\n  \"resultMsg\": \"success\",\r\n  \"resultObject\": {\r\n    \"statusCd\": \"00A\",\r\n    \"updatorId\": \"更新者ID\",\r\n    \"updatedTime\": \"更新时间\",\r\n    \"knowledgeId\": \"知识库ID\",\r\n    \"catalogItemId\": \"目录项ID\",\r\n    \"tenantId\": \"租户ID\",\r\n    \"spaceId\": \"空间ID\",\r\n    \"knowledgeType\": \"知识库类型\",\r\n    \"knowledgeName\": \"知识库名称\",\r\n    \"knowledgeIcon\": \"知识库图标\",\r\n    \"fileCounts\": \"文件数量\",\r\n    \"knowledgeStatus\": \"知识库状态\",\r\n    \"topicId\": \"主题ID\",\r\n    \"knowledgeStrategy\": \"DOCCHAIN策略JSON字符串\",\r\n    \"isExist\": \"是否为关联知识库\",\r\n    \"strategy\": \"DOCCHAIN策略对象\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```','F'),(202602215,'知识库删除','删除指定知识库','/bote/manager/knowledge/deleteKnowledgeBase','GET',NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"children\":[{\"description\":\"租户id\",\"name\":\"tenantId\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"require\":true,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"cffe1230-dcec-4dde-845f-579bde5d4be9\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"description\":\"知识库id\",\"name\":\"knowledgeId\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"require\":true,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"c18ef955-4400-45fe-8484-093089d6301a\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]}]}',NULL,'{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"name\":\"root\",\"key\":-1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"resultCode\",\"description\":\"resultCode\",\"key\":\"d307ee01-97e3-4d4c-9479-48b9f38cfe84\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"resultMsg\",\"description\":\"resultMsg\",\"key\":\"793a124a-c21b-4796-b3c4-d20e22902e8c\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]}],\"parentKeyPath\":[]}','{\r\n  \"input\": \"curl --location --request GET \'http://10.10.176.135:9500/bote/manager/knowledge/deleteKnowledgeBase?tenantId=1293851905554751488&knowledgeId=1334792822373715968\' --header \'Authorization: Bearer abcd***1234\'\",\r\n  \"output\": \"{\n  \"resultCode\": \"0\",\n  \"resultMsg\": \"success\"\n}\"\r\n}',202602202,'2026-02-02 18:09:02','00A','2026-02-02 18:09:02',1,1,NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"Cookie 请求头\",\"name\":\"Cookie\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"axef8ad2a-csa1-48a8-bss1-ba5155acg4da\",\"parentKey\":-1},{\"description\":\"API 密钥, 值为 Bearer 密钥\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"type\"