se,\n    \"hasNextPage\": false,\n    \"navigatePages\": 8,\n    \"navigatepageNums\": [1],\n    \"navigateFirstPage\": 1,\n    \"navigateLastPage\": 1\n  }\n}\"\r\n}',202602202,'2026-02-02 19:40:51','00A','2026-02-02 19:40:51',1,1,NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"Cookie 请求头\",\"name\":\"Cookie\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"axef8ad2a-csa1-48a8-bss1-ba5155acg4da\",\"parentKey\":-1},{\"description\":\"API 密钥, 值为 Bearer 密钥\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"245e2b31-bff6-2c1a-ec7c-3cf340480a98\",\"parentKey\":-1}]}','知识库列表查询服务\r\n\r\n## 接口鉴权\r\n两种方式:\r\n\r\n* 使用 session 鉴权: 传递 `Cookie` 请求头，里面要包含 session 的 cookie（一般名为 `BOTE_SESSION`）\r\n  * 适用于从业务系统前端触发的调用，此时业务系统后端可以从请求中获取到 cookie, 然后转发给博特平台后端\r\n  * 博特平台不同环境使用的 session cookie 名称不同，为方便兼容所有环境，建议直接透传所有 cookie\r\n  * 示例: `Cookie: BOTE_SESSION=xxx`\r\n* API 密钥: 传递 `Authorization` 请求头，值为 \"Bearer 密钥\"\r\n  * 密钥在平台的【设置 - API 开放 - 鉴权】中申请\r\n  * 不依赖业务系统前端的 cookie, 适用于业务系统后端异步或者在定时任务中调用\r\n  * 示例: `Authorization: Bearer xxx`\r\n\r\n## 接口地址\r\n\r\n* 请求方法: POST\r\n* 请求地址: `/bote/manager/knowledge/queryKnowledgeBasePage`（前面加上环境地址，比如生产环境完整地址为 `http://10.10.176.135:9500/bote/manager/knowledge/queryKnowledgeBasePage`）\r\n\r\n## 接口入参（请求体）\r\n| 字段 | 类型 | 必填 | 说明 |\r\n|------|------|------|------|\r\n| pageNum | integer | 否 | 当前页，默认为 1 |\r\n| pageSize | integer | 否 | 页条数，默认 20 |\r\n| catalogItemId | integer | 否 | 目录ID |\r\n| tenantId | integer | 是 | 租户ID |\r\n| searchContent | string | 否 | 模糊查询知识库名称 |\r\n| spaceId | integer | 否 | 空间ID |\r\n\r\n## 接口出参\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"resultCode\": \"0\",\r\n  \"resultMsg\": \"success\",\r\n  \"resultObject\": {\r\n    \"total\": \"总数\",\r\n    \"list\": \"知识库列表\",\r\n    \"pageNum\": \"当前页\",\r\n    \"pageSize\": \"每页条数\",\r\n    \"pages\": \"总页数\",\r\n    \"isFirstPage\": \"是否首页\",\r\n    \"isLastPage\": \"是否末页\",\r\n    \"hasPreviousPage\": \"是否有上一页\",\r\n    \"hasNextPage\": \"是否有下一页\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```','F'),(202602223,'知识库详情查询','根据知识库ID查询知识库详情','/bote/manager/knowledge/findKnowledgeBase','GET',NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"children\":[{\"description\":\"知识库id\",\"name\":\"knowledgeId\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"require\":true,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"0d37af7c-dc37-4782-ac18-d87a09ddbb98\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"description\":\"租户id\",\"name\":\"tenantId\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"require\":true,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"b4fe67ed-292d-4654-8ea3-5d19cb3ac8d1\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]}]}',NULL,'{\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"name\":\"root\",\"key\":-1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"resultCode\",\"description\":\"resultCode\",\"key\":\"54f9dbfc-9905-46d1-b38c-d1caa69f7ca6\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1],\"parentType\":\"object\"},{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"resultMsg\",\"description\":\"resultMsg\",\"key\":\"4dc55117-3bb1-4fff-ade4-57cb6223924e\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1],\"parentType\":\"object\"},{\"type\":\"object\",\"name\":\"resultObject\",\"description\":\"resultObject\",\"key\":\"eaee0623-54e9-4582-a793-be2ee26bea50\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"name\":\"statusCd\",\"description\":\"状态代码:00A-有效,00X-归档\",\"key\":\"500e71ad-717c-43a4-be2b-71d16f1987d5\",\"parentKey\":\"eaee0623-54e9-4582-a793-be2ee26bea50\",\"parentKeyPath\":[-1,\"eaee0623-54e9-4582-a793-be2ee26bea50\"],\"parentType\":\"object\"},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"creatorId\",\"description\":\"创建者ID\",\"key\":\"9b4af1b0-0985-48a5-9221-6097049adf6e\",\"parentKey\":\"eaee0623-54e9-4582-a793-be2ee26bea50\",\"parentKeyPath\":[-1,\"eaee0623-54e9-4582-a793-be2ee26bea50\"],\"parentType\":\"object\"},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"updatorId\",\"description\":\"更新者ID\",\"key