"resultMsg\": \"success\",\n  \"resultObject\": {\n    \"libraryId\": \"lbrrG6KMEt7QVxmf81xadwUB0\",\n    \"libraryName\": \"显示测试的\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"libraryIcon\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\",\n    \"color\": \"\",\n    \"visibilityScope\": \"PUBLIC\",\n    \"creator\": {\n      \"userId\": 1,\n      \"username\": \"admin2\"\n    },\n    \"memberCount\": 0,\n    \"documentCount\": 2,\n    \"createdTime\": \"2026-02-02 14:08:12\",\n    \"updatedTime\": \"2026-02-02 14:14:40\",\n    \"permissions\": \"OWNER\",\n    \"isFavorite\": false,\n    \"members\": [\n      {\n        \"subjectType\": \"USER\",\n        \"subjectId\": 1,\n        \"subjectName\": \"admin2\",\n        \"permissionType\": \"MANAGE\",\n        \"isOwner\": true\n      }\n    ],\n    \"creatorUserId\": 1,\n    \"tenantId\": 0,\n    \"spaceId\": 0\n  }\n}\"\r\n}',202602202,'2026-02-02 15:23:29','00A','2026-02-02 16:36:20',1,1,NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"Cookie 请求头\",\"name\":\"Cookie\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"axef8ad2a-csa1-48a8-bss1-ba5155acg4da\",\"parentKey\":-1},{\"description\":\"API 密钥, 值为 Bearer 密钥\",\"name\":\"Authorization\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"245e2b31-bff6-2c1a-ec7c-3cf340480a98\",\"parentKey\":-1}]}','文档库详情查询服务\r\n\r\n## 接口鉴权\r\n两种方式:\r\n\r\n* 使用 session 鉴权: 传递 `Cookie` 请求头，里面要包含 session 的 cookie（一般名为 `BOTE_SESSION`）\r\n  * 适用于从业务系统前端触发的调用，此时业务系统后端可以从请求中获取到 cookie, 然后转发给博特平台后端\r\n  * 博特平台不同环境使用的 session cookie 名称不同，为方便兼容所有环境，建议直接透传所有 cookie\r\n  * 示例: `Cookie: BOTE_SESSION=xxx`\r\n* API 密钥: 传递 `Authorization` 请求头，值为 \"Bearer 密钥\"\r\n  * 密钥在平台的【设置 - API 开放 - 鉴权】中申请\r\n  * 不依赖业务系统前端的 cookie, 适用于业务系统后端异步或者在定时任务中调用\r\n  * 示例: `Authorization: Bearer xxx`\r\n\r\n## 接口地址\r\n\r\n* 请求方法: GET\r\n* 请求地址: `/bote/dc/library/detail/{libraryId}`（将 {libraryId} 替换为实际文档库ID，前面加上环境地址）\r\n\r\n## 接口入参\r\n* 路径参数: libraryId - 文档库ID\r\n* Query参数: tenantId（必填）、spaceId（选填）\r\n\r\n## 接口出参\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"resultCode\": \"0\",\r\n  \"resultMsg\": \"success\",\r\n  \"resultObject\": {\r\n    \"libraryId\": \"lbrrG6KMEt7QVxmf81xadwUB0\",\r\n    \"libraryName\": \"显示测试的\",\r\n    \"description\": \"\",\r\n    \"libraryIcon\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\",\r\n    \"color\": \"\",\r\n    \"visibilityScope\": \"PUBLIC\",\r\n    \"creator\": {\r\n      \"userId\": 1,\r\n      \"username\": \"admin2\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"memberCount\": 0,\r\n    \"documentCount\": 2,\r\n    \"createdTime\": \"2026-02-02 14:08:12\",\r\n    \"updatedTime\": \"2026-02-02 14:14:40\",\r\n    \"permissions\": \"OWNER\",\r\n    \"isFavorite\": false,\r\n    \"members\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"subjectType\": \"USER\",\r\n        \"subjectId\": 1,\r\n        \"subjectName\": \"admin2\",\r\n        \"permissionType\": \"MANAGE\",\r\n        \"isOwner\": true\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"creatorUserId\": 1,\r\n    \"tenantId\": 0,\r\n    \"spaceId\": 0\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```','F'),(20260220211,'文档库文档列表查询','查询文档库中文档树形列表','/bote/dc/document/node/tree','GET',NULL,'{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"name\":\"root\",\"type\":\"object\",\"require\":false,\"value\":\"\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"children\":[{\"description\":\"文档库ID,示例值(lbryQkKp9XJEl)\",\"name\":\"libraryId\",\"type\":\"string\",\"require\":true,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"1232677e-b1e0-4e3f-a6cb-95c73929b46c\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"description\":\"租户id\",\"name\":\"tenantId\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"require\":true,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"6bf83ce4-72fd-433d-a73b-315ca2918c1e\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"description\":\"空间id\",\"name\":\"spaceId\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"require\":true,\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"fa56eb3b-25a5-46e2-8cfe-ecf602e3b717\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[-1]},{\"description\":\"环境租户id，最好传递跟上面租户id一样的值\",\"name\":\"envTenantId\",\"type\":\"integer