\"文本内容\\\\\", \\\\\"单选\\\\\": \\\\\"选项1\\\\\"}\r\n    *  详情请参考[飞书开发者文档](https://open.feishu.cn/document/server-docs/docs/bitable-v1/app-table-record/batch_update)\r\n  * 出参\r\n     *  当 code 的值固定返回401时，此时需要用户打开飞书授权链接，进行授权，授权链接会返回在authUrl字段中。\r\n  ## 插件出参示例\r\n  ```json\r\n  {\r\n    \"code\": \"0\",\r\n    \"msg\": \"success\",\r\n    \"data\": {\r\n      \"records\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"fields\": \"{\\\"单选\\\":\\\"2\\\",\\\"文本2\\\":\\\"更新一个文本内容\\\"}\",\r\n          \"recordId\": \"rec3V6QGyc\"\r\n        }\r\n      ],\r\n      \"authUrl\": null\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  ```','1','飞书多维表格数据表批量更新记录','飞书多维表格数据表批量更新记录','data:image/svg+xml;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"应用ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"57d2dc0f-aeda-4806-b6d2-33275f31ab16\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"应用密钥\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"7035a162-1141-46cb-8a7a-0b32e02a833b\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appSecret\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格链接地址\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"c7e63b60-03c8-4908-bd3c-9533df01930e\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"url\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"表格ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"bd53315b-0f91-4e05-b299-57a0929ba07e\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"tableId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格唯一标识\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"055761e0-58b4-4c84-a0b7-8e3b953d69b8\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath