udioFormat| String | 否 | 音频格式，默认mp3 |\r\n#### 示例请求体\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"fileId\": \"123\",\r\n  \"audioFormat\": \"mp3\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n## 3. 响应参数\r\n| 参数名 | 类型     | 说明 |\r\n|-----------|--------|--------------------------------------|\r\n| fileId | String | 转换后的音频文件ID |\r\n#### 示例响应\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"fileId\": \"124\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n## 4. 备注\r\n- 输入视频格式：mp4、3gp、avi、flv、mkv、mpeg、webm、wmv、mov\r\n- 输出音频格式：mp3(默认)、flac、wav、opus、ac3、ogg\r\n- 文件太大可能导致转换超时，建议转换100M以下视频文件。','1','视频提取音频','提取视频文件里面的音频。','./images/plugin/ico-plugin-2.png','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"视频文件ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"2835eddf-e2e8-4ab6-aa86-472e73a94051\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"fileId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"音频格式，默认mp3\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"4f942f25-849c-46f5-b539-d75789a55aa5\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"controlType\":\"select\",\"options\":[{\"value\":\"mp3\",\"label\":\"mp3\"},{\"value\":\"flac\",\"label\":\"flac\"},{\"value\":\"wav\",\"label\":\"wav\"},{\"value\":\"opus\",\"label\":\"opus\"},{\"value\":\"ac3\",\"label\":\"ac3\"},{\"value\":\"ogg\",\"label\":\"ogg\"}],\"name\":\"audioFormat\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"音频文件ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"3b5793e2-d6f2-4b73-9e06-665d20ae5d4e\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"fileId\",\"children\":null}]}',2025041801,'2025-08-27 09:34:21','00X','2025-08-29 17:34:06',1,1,NULL,'F',NULL),(1277803825212063744,-1,'larkGetMetadata','## 插件描述\r\n  飞书获取多维表格元数据\r\n  ## 操作说明\r\n   * 需要在飞书开放平台，创建一个应用。\r\n   * 在应用内的凭证与基础信息中，获取APP ID和  App Secret。\r\n   * 在应用内的开发配置的权限管理，请确保开通用户身份权限的以下权限：查看、评论、编辑和管理多维表格（bitable:app）、离线访问已授权数据（offline_access）、查看知识库（wiki:wiki:readonly）、搜索云文档（search:docs:read）、查看云空间中文件元数据（drive:drive.metadata:readonly）的权限。\r\n   * 在应用内的安全设置中，配置重定向URL。\r\n      * url部分：/bote/lark/callback，网关请根据环境进行拼接，如当前环境接口为`http://127.0.0.1/api/xxxx`，则重定向URL为 `http://127.0.0.1/api/bote/lark/callback`\r\n   * 对此应用进行发布。\r\n  ## 插件参数说明\r\n  * 入参\r\n    *  appToken 与 url 只要填其一\r\n    *  详情请参考[飞书开发者文档](https://open.feishu.cn/document/server-docs/docs/bitable-v1/app/get)\r\n  * 出参\r\n     *  当 code 的值固定返回401时，此时需要用户打开飞书授权链接，进行授权，授权链接会返回在authUrl字段中。\r\n  ## 插件出参示例\r\n  ```json\r\n  {\r\n    \"code\": \"0\",\r\n    \"msg\": \"success\",\r\n    \"data\": {\r\n      \"app\": {\r\n        \"appToken\": \"SDrebZXr9aYgSxsVjpIcNJUdnbf\",\r\n        \"name\": \"测试08210588\",\r\n        \"revision\": \"1\",\r\n        \"isAdvanced\": false,\r\n        \"timeZone\": null,\r\n        \"formulaType\": \"2\",\r\n        \"advanceVersion\": null\r\n      },\r\n      \"authUrl\": null\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  ```','1','飞书获取多维表格元数据','飞书获取多维表格元数据','data:image/svg+xml;base64,','{\"key\":\"-1\",\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"应用ID\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"908419e2-2c1d-4eec-80ab-a0fde4c3671e\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appId\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"应用密钥\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"7dbbf78b-ce98-42b7-bc05-2d80378cbaa0\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appSecret\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格链接地址\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"6b123b16-d68d-4a17-8de1-c08712af1859\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"url\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"多维表格唯一标识\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"5f5c0999-ef55-4df9-b2a3-965e647d40a9\",\"parentKey\":\"-1\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appToken\",\"children\":null}]}','{\"key\":-1,\"description\":\"根节点\",\"type\":\"object\",\"parentKeyPath\":[],\"parentKey\":\"\",\"name\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"响应编码，成功为0\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"4af67ea5-3e94-45d4-ae46-3aa9873d9a37\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"code\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"错误信息\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"763c7ff0-a682-47ee-ac43-b6ace8f4acf9\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"msg\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"返回对象\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"531a8eaf-5a25-42a6-8693-5be8bf916389\",\"parentKey\":-1,\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"data\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"多维表格元数据\",\"type\":\"object\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"9bce2c98-5f93-4b95-9e3b-5529252d6cd4\",\"parentKey\":\"531a8eaf-5a25-42a6-8693-5be8bf916389\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"849f7413-5836-460c-a6db-35bacfa7a28e\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"name\":\"app\",\"children\":[{\"description\":\"多维表格唯一标识\",\"type\":\"string\",\"value\":\"\",\"key\":\"613b81a0-6190-4138-802f-033c269092df\",\"parentKey\":\"9bce2c98-5f93-4b95-9e3b-5529252d6cd4\",\"parentKeyPath\":[\"-1\",\"849f7413-5836-460c-a6db-35bacfa7a28e\",\"508b87c1-ec88-442f-8325-350651f29db3\"],\"parentType\":\"object\",\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"operation\":null,\"name\":\"appToken\",\"children\":null},{\"description\":\"